---
import ContactLink from '../components/ContactLink';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Emet Labs builds security tooling for agentic AI systems."
>
	<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-32">
		<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
			<p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-black/50 lg:col-span-3">
				About
			</p>
			<div class="max-w-3xl lg:col-span-8">
				<h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-light tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-5xl">
					Emet Labs
				</h1>

				<p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-black/70">
					We build security tooling for agentic AI systems.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-snug text-black/70">
					Our main product is {" "}
					<a href="/sentinel" class="underline hover:no-underline">Sentinel</a>,
					{" "}a runtime verification engine that checks what an AI deployment actually did
					against specifications and reports the conclusion with evidence. It's in private
					development.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-snug text-black/70">
					To build Sentinel, we need real trace data from production agents. If you run
					agents with tracing enabled and want to help, {" "}
					<a href="/trace-grab" class="underline hover:no-underline">trace-grab</a>{" "}
					is an open-source tool that sanitizes your trace exports on your own machine
					before you share them with us. No sensitive data leaves your environment.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-10">
					<ContactLink class="inline-flex text-sm font-medium underline hover:no-underline" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
